    slug:"pikobuy-shoes-buying-guide",
    title:"PikoBuy Shoes Buying Guide: Size, QC, Returns and Shipping",
    deck:"A practical PikoBuy shoes guide for checking size, warehouse QC photos, return eligibility, packaging volume and shipping decisions.",
